 "remarks": "Wow!!! Old world charm meets New World amenities with state-of-the-art renovations! This fabulous North Stamford cottage set on a bucolic acre offers privacy with all modern amenities including brand new gourmet kitchen & bath, newly installed Central Air, all new lighting and beautiful hardwood floors. The upstairs embraces a spacious bedroom with adjacent sitting room or study, plus dressing/vanity area. There is a combination heavy duty washer/dryer with plenty of closet space for storage. Enjoy the tranquility from your outdoor patio where you can grill or just relax. Garage is for owner's personal use, but there is parking in front. EXCELLENT CREDIT & REFERENCES A MUST!! PETS ON CASE BY CASE BASIS AT THE DISCREETION OF LANDLORD.",
